  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICDDR,B 2005-2007 - ICDDR,BCore supp05-07</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ICDDR,B 2005-2007</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida&apos;s continued support to ICDDR,B includes both a core support and support to seven projects. The focus of Sida&apos;s project support is on child health and includes research on diarrhoeal diseases, nutrition and arsenic. The project &quot;Arsenic in drinking water and child development&quot; is part of larger programme on arsenic at ICDDR,B which also includes a project supported by the ASIA Dept through Sw.Emb.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sidas fortsatta st&#xf6;d till ICDDR,B inkl b&#xe5;de ett basst&#xf6;d och st&#xf6;d till sju projekt.Projektst&#xf6;det fokuserar p&#xe5; barns h&#xe4;lsa och inkl forskning kring diarr&#xe9;sjukdomar, nutrition och arsenik. Projektet &quot;Arsenic in drinking water and child development&quot; &#xe4;r del av ett st&#xf6;rre program vid ICDDR,B och som ocks&#xe5; inkl. ett projekt som erh&#xe5;ller st&#xf6;d av Asien avd. genom svenska amb. &quot;arsenic in tube well water and health&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
